._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# AI assistant context folders
.claude/

# local .env backups (contain secrets)
.env.bak.*
# Currently holds live credentials despite the name - see the note in the
# session. Ignored so `git add -A` cannot publish it. Replace the values with
# placeholders before removing this line.
.env.example

# local user database (password hashes)
# (the SQLite user store was removed along with sign-in)

# Assembled Hugging Face Space (regenerate with scripts/build_hf_space.py)
build/
.vercel
.env*
# ...except the templates, which carry no values and are the documentation for
# what each service needs.
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
